<title>USA: Acme Metals Inc Q3 earnings fall.</title>
<headline>Acme Metals Inc Q3 earnings fall.</headline>
<dateline>RIVERDALE, Ill. 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.25		    $0.45</p>
<p> Net			  2,900		    5,300</p>
<p> Revs		     125,174		  122,211</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  11,632		   11,610</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)  </p>
<p>	  NINE MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.82		    $1.90</p>
<p> Net			  9,500		   22,100</p>
<p> Revs		     378,307		  389,930</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  11,618		   11,604</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: '96 Q3 and nine months operating income includes costs of $3.3 million and $6.4 million, respectively, for training and start up related to Acme's modernization and expansion project at its steel-making subsidiary in Riverdale.</p>
</text>
